{"id":"n4-089","title":"～たら どうですか (〜tara doudesuka)","jlptLevel":4,"shortExplanation":"Express a suggestion or advice; 'what if', 'how about', 'why don't you'.","longExplanation":"The ～たら どうですか grammar point is used to make a suggestion or give advice to someone. It can be translated as 'what if', 'how about', or 'why don't you' in English. This structure is used with the た-form of verbs to make a gentle, polite suggestion.","formation":"Verb-た form + ら どうですか","examples":[{"jp":"スキーに行ったらどうですか？","romaji":"Sukii ni ittara doudesuka?","en":"How about going skiing?","words":[{"surface":"スキー","vocabId":null},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行っ","vocabId":"1578850","reading":"いく","baseForm":"行く"},{"surface":"たら","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"た"},{"surface":"どう","vocabId":"1451730","reading":"どう"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"？","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5,6]},{"jp":"少し休んだらどうですか？","romaji":"Sukoshi yasundara doudesuka?","en":"What if you take a little break?","words":[{"surface":"少し","vocabId":"1348870","reading":"すこし"},{"surface":"休ん","vocabId":"1227560","reading":"やすむ","baseForm":"休む"},{"surface":"だら","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"どう","vocabId":"1451730","reading":"どう"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"？","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2,3,4,5]},{"jp":"この本を読んだらどうですか？","romaji":"Kono hon wo yondara doudesuka?","en":"Why don't you read this book?","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"本","vocabId":"1522150","reading":"ほん"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"読ん","vocabId":"1456360","reading":"よむ","baseForm":"読む"},{"surface":"だら","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"どう","vocabId":"1451730","reading":"どう"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"？","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6,7]},{"jp":"タクシーで帰ったらどうですか？","romaji":"Takushii de kaettara doudesuka?","en":"How about going home by taxi?","words":[{"surface":"タクシー","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"帰っ","vocabId":"1221270","reading":"かえる","baseForm":"帰る"},{"surface":"たら","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"た"},{"surface":"どう","vocabId":"1451730","reading":"どう"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"？","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5,6]}]}